        "action_date": "2025-01-15",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Fighting Oppression until the Reign of Castro Ends or the FORCE Act</strong></p><p>This bill prohibits removing Cuba from the list of state sponsors of terrorism until the President makes the determination that a transition government in Cuba is in power.</p>",
